WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.846
Today shows who still
needs a note.

2
00:00:11.846 --> 00:00:15.520
One tap opens it.

3
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:30.494
Answer the service plan
by tapping.

4
00:00:30.494 --> 00:00:38.562
Then tap what happened
on the shift.

5
00:00:38.562 --> 00:00:42.931
Tap Write my note. It drafts
from what you tapped.

6
00:00:42.931 --> 00:00:49.632
Read it. Change anything
that is not right.

7
00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:57.699
Type your name, or sign
on the glass.

8
00:00:57.699 --> 00:01:01.664
Signed and locked,
with the time to the minute.

9
00:01:01.664 --> 00:01:06.433
It cannot be edited.
A fix goes on as an addendum.

10
00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:11.367
Then straight on to
the next person.
